# My App
     The School Dashboard is a web app for managing school transactions.
It allows administrators to view and track transactions by school.
Users can update transaction statuses manually or via a webhook.
Built with React.js for the frontend and Node.js for the backend.
Secure authentication with JWT ensures safe access to the dashboard.



